WEBVTT

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:43.790
Grandma, how are you?

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:46.660
I'm doing my best here in high school.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:49.540
The studying has been difficult.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:52.650
The sea isn't very close either, so it's a little sad.

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:55.470
But I have wonderful friends.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.210
I'm all right.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:01.510
Hey, Chika.

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:02.680
Huh?

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:06.270
I've been meaning to ask this for a while, though.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:07.860
What is that?

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.980
Heh, a d-doll.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:12.160
I can tell by looking.

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:15.260
It's handmade, right? Whose model is it for?

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.450
T-That is, um...

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.410
Okay, then, Minazuki-san!

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.630
Y-Yes?

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:27.210
In 1756, what war occurred
between Austria and Prussia?

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:28.710
Ah, um...

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:31.290
The Seven Years' War.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.000
Yes, that is correct.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:38.190
In world history, this war was caused in part by the rivalry between...

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:40.970
Komiya Natsuki-chan who is always cheerful.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:46.220
And Aizawa Chizuru-chan, who is a little bashful but very kind.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.350
The two of them are my best friends.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:09.450
Yay!

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:10.550
Oh, man!

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:12.540
You really are fast, Chika!

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:15.120
Yeah!

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.630
On the other hand...

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:26.000
Geez! You're hopeless, Chizuru.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.520
I'm sorry.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:31.690
We three are the only ones
serious about the swimming club.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.650
Try a little harder, okay?

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:35.700
Okay...

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:38.480
I-It's okay!

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.450
Chizuru-chan's trying her best!

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.750
She only had to stop and
stand twice during her laps!

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:44.920
Right?

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:45.890
Yes.

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:47.830
Geez, Chika, you're too easy on her.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:51.620
You'll be able to swim even longer tomorrow.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:53.160
Yes.

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:54.880
Thank you, Minazuki-san.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:58.380
Ah, Geez. I told you it's okay to call me Chika.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.160
Chika, your notebook fell.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.930
W-Wha-

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.710
What is this?

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:09.840
Oh, my. It's Chika-san with a man.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.850
U-Um, that is...

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:15.010
Chika, could this guy be...

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.820
You shouldn't just look without asking.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.030
It's something dear to me.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.990
Hey, that attitude!

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:26.080
This person, Chika-san, is he...

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.250
Well...

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.040
Hey, who is he?

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:35.040
For now, someone we live together.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.340
Eh?!

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:37.640
T-Together living?!

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:38.710
T-Together living?!

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:41.170
Yet, she's a little girl,

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.630
She has gone that far!

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.840
H-Hey, Chika!

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:49.210
W-W-What, Natsuki-chan?

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:53.720
Heh?!

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:54.980
Tomorrow?!

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.570
And so...

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:05.740
My friends said they wanted to come
here tomorrow since it's Sunday, but...

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.100
Heh!

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:09.200
Chika-rin's friends, huh?

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.660
I look forward to it.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:11.490
Yeah!

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:13.810
Heh? It's okay to bring them?

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:15.510
Yes, of course.

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:18.250
If they're your friends,
we'll give them a warm welcome!

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.250
Isn't it great, Chika-chan?

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:20.950
Yeah.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:22.630
Yay! All right!

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.670
All right!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.130
Banzai!

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:27.010
Ah!

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:33.830
Well, it's not like they will come over every day.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:35.770
So I don't mind at all.

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:38.700
Thank goodness.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.330
But...

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:45.240
So, until tomorrow.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:49.410
Chika, we're going to take
a good look at your boyfriend.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:50.950
I'm looking forward to it.

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:52.480
What?

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:53.910
See you later!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.780
They called him my <i>boyfriend.</i>

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:08.290
But if this happens, and Natsuki and Chizuru
meet Onii-chan, they'll ask him all kinds of things.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.670
That's bad, after all.

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:15.000
{Big Brother}Onii-chan is sure to be surprised.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.730
And he might come to hate me then.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.010
Ah, what should I do?

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:28.490
It hurts.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.890
Thank goodness.

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:37.650
{Big Brother}Onii-chan is all right.

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:51.390
And in the end, I couldn't sleep.

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:54.010
Hey, Chika!

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:54.600
Ah!

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.710
Chika, what's wrong?

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:02.880
Are you okay?

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:04.150
I-I'm fine.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.520
I'm fine!

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.660
Oh, welcome.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.100
Oh, Aoi Onee-chan!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.230
H-Hello.

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:21.420
Hello.

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:23.250
Hello.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:29.050
Well, we shouldn't just stand here and talk.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:33.720
So, it's not only you two living together.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:36.950
I never said it was just the two of us.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.050
Thank goodness.

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:39.880
She hasn't gone that far.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.120
Welcome, thank you for coming.

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:46.940
Aoi Onee-chan is the {Ooya-san}landlord here.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.570
Here is some tea.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.370
So beautiful. A kimono!

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:53.530
Yeah.

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:56.490
Thank you for the food!

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.740
Oh, this is delicious!

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:02.080
Whoa, yummy!

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:04.480
I-It's delicious.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:06.090
It's called cherry blossom pie.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:08.150
Cherry blossom pie?

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.670
It's Aoi Onee-chan's original idea.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:13.220
Eh? Aoi-san made this?

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.250
Amazing!

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.090
There's red bean paste inside.

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:18.630
Oh, and just a hint of cherry blossom.

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:22.660
There are vinegar-soaked
cherry blossom petals mixed in.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:23.640
Heh!

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:26.860
Oh, why don't you teach them the recipe?

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:27.990
Eh?

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:33.950
These are all of the ingredients.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.780
There are less than I thought there'd be.

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.950
Where should we start from?

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.410
Well, right.

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:45.910
All right, while they're doing that,
I'll go explain this to {Big Brother}Onii-chan!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.560
Oh, no!

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:53.670
They might be asking
about {Big Brother}Onii-chan right now!

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:59.930
For the pie dough, the bread and
wheat flour must be sifted together.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:03.370
If you do that, the crust will be nice and crisp.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:04.520
Heh!

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:09.690
It might be okay for it to be a little sweeter.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:15.720
The reason I control the sweetness is
simply to match it to Kaoru-sama's taste.

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:16.530
<i>Kaoru-sama?</i>

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:21.720
Ah, Kaoru-sama is someone
who lives in the other house.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:26.050
Stop that conversation!

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.520
Huh, that was such a fright.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.560
What were you doing, Chika?

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:47.690
Sorry.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:52.070
But it was a close call.

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:56.680
How is the water?

00:09:58.500 --> 00:09:59.540
It's fine!

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:00.530
The water's great!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.180
Really?

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:04.290
Then please take your time.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:10.020
Aoi Onee-chan.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.050
Yes?

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:12.210
I'm sorry.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:13.120
Eh?!

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:16.720
Ah, it's all right. No problem.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:19.830
But you're covered in flour, too.

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:22.630
You should come in with us.

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:26.070
I will take my bath after I clean up the kitchen.

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:29.800
If there are any problems,
please don't hesitate to tell me.

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:37.610
If this keeps up, it feels like it'll be
a bother to everyone else, too...

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.550
What should I do?

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:41.640
What should I do, {Big Brother}Onii-chan?

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:45.290
{Big Brother}Onii-chan?

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:49.250
W-Wait a moment!

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:54.130
Ah, there are only girls in here!

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:56.120
W-Wait a moment!

00:10:58.460 --> 00:10:59.800
Wait!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.750
W-Wait a moment!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.360
Huh, Chika-rin?

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.210
Huh!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:42.840
Yeah, an afternoon bath is a good thing!

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.960
Tina Nee-chan...

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:51.840
Wow, it must be nice to be blonde.

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:53.940
I want to dye my hair, too...

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.780
This is my natural hair. I was born with it.

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:57.650
Natural hair?

00:11:58.020 --> 00:12:01.790
Despite how she acts,
Tina Nee-chan's a real American.

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.620
Oh, is that so?!

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:04.990
Hey, Chika!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:07.370
What do you mean <i>despite how she acts</i>?

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:09.330
Sorry.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.830
No, I won't forgive. Punishment!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.700
No, I said I'm sorry!

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:15.750
Why you! How about this?

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:15.750
No!

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:18.300
You're still small, huh?

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.710
No! No!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:22.910
I'm looking forward to seeing your size when you're older!

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:25.340
Could it be she's into that?

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:35.650
This feels great.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:38.440
After a bath, a spring wind feels nice and cool.

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.480
I'm telling you that's not it!

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:49.540
Okay, we've had a bath,
so should we go somewhere?

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.410
Go somewhere? Why?

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.650
Heh, ah, well...

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:59.440
I guess I can't fool them that easily.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:00.880
This is bad.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:05.470
I really want to introduce
them to {Big Brother}Onii-chan, but...

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.120
Chika's boyfriend, take care of Chika.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.690
Um, Mr. Boyfriend?

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:14.100
What do you like about Chika-san?

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:16.530
B-Boyfriend?

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:17.560
Like?

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.460
Huh, no, that is...

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:22.930
No, no!

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:25.800
If they meet, something horrible will happen!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.710
It couldn't be, {Big Brother}Onii-chan...

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:35.910
This is bad.

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.580
I have to distract them!

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:38.420
Huh!

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:41.150
A ten meter long firefly squid!

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:44.950
What are you doing?

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:47.860
What? Where, where?

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.930
Where's the huge firefly squid?

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.800
Oh, Chika-chan.

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:53.350
Your friends have arrived, huh?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.960
T-Tae Nee-chan, huh?

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:03.370
The light bulbs have gotten old,
so I thought I'd replace them.

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:06.180
Be careful, Tae Nee-chan.

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:07.940
I'll be all right.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.040
They're huge.

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:19.540
Hey, I'll change them for you.

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:22.490
I said I'm all right.

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:25.800
Chika-chan, you really are a worrywart.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.220
Ah, that's...

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:28.550
What?

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.220
Hot!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:44.480
Okay!

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:45.710
Right.

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:51.990
Thank you all so much.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:56.430
Tae Nee-chan, you're too sure of yourself.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:58.160
And there.

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.370
A discovery, discovery!

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:04.530
What could it be?

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:05.800
Don't know.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:09.070
If it's in the garden, could it be Senpai?

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:10.040
Senpai?

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:11.680
Heh? {Big Brother}Onii-chan?

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.350
This is bad!

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:27.990
Wow, this is great!

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.760
It's an import, import!

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:31.330
It's so cool!

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:34.330
I want to become a woman that will match this!

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:35.950
Smooth, smooth!

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:38.660
Oh, that's all.

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:44.590
Excuse me, what are you doing to my car?

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:46.680
<i>My car?</i>

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:49.150
That's right. This is my car.

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:50.200
What about it?

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:53.180
No way.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.260
It doesn't fit you.

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.150
What did you say?

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:58.250
Ah no, I said what I meant.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:01.860
Geez, how dare you!

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:03.600
M-Mayu Nee-chan.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.570
You're okay with not going?

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:10.620
Yes.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:12.940
You're very quiet, aren't you?

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:14.360
Ah, no.

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:18.080
I'm s-slow.

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:18.880
Eh!

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:22.330
I'm not as quick as other people.

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:27.580
That's why I'm always troubling
Chika-san and Natsuki-san.

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.800
You're like me.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:33.650
I'm the same way.

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:36.430
You saw before, right?

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:40.800
But I don't get discouraged.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:43.430
Because there are people who support me.

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:47.870
Even if I can't do it on my own,
if everyone is there, I can.

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:50.310
I'm sure that I'll be able to.

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:53.410
That's why I can try so hard, yeah.

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:55.640
People who support you.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.490
You have them too, right?

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:02.470
Near by.

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.120
Yes.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:05.820
Good.

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:07.080
Try your best.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:10.000
Yes, I'll try my best!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.960
Um, if I do the best that I can...

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:17.230
will I have big breasts like you, Taeko-san?

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:19.860
R-Right, you might.

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:25.810
I'll try my best!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:31.110
Anyway, would you not touch
my car without permission?

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.270
It'll get dirty.

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.530
What? Get dirty?

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.860
I'm saying that it will get dirty!

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.560
Oh?

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:41.650
Let's see.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:45.500
W-What are you doing?

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.760
Stop, don't drool on it!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.800
It's a smooth import, all right!

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.420
Stop it already!

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:53.050
Come on, you two!

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:55.220
I won't forgive you!

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:57.220
Oh, want to do it?

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.680
Someone!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.280
Aoi Onee-chan!

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:03.850
Tina Nee-chan!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.140
Tae Nee-chan!

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.210
