00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.880
If you're going to fight, do it elsewhere!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.710
Y-Yes.                             Y-Yes.

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:39.410
I'm sorry.                       I'm sorry.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.430
H-He's not here.

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:49.690
If you're looking for Kaoru, he left a while ago
to help with a professor's lecture or something.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:52.690
T-That was so!

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.400
Chika-rin, what's wrong?

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:01.400
Thanks for today, Chika.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:02.970
I'm glad I came.

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:05.370
Ah, r-really?

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:10.500
Hey, I'm sorry that I wasn't able
to have you meet him properly.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.310
Eh?!

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:12.380
With who?

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.320
Eh, well, that is...

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:18.510
Well, my, um...

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:21.360
Ah, your boyfriend!

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:23.560
I completely forgot about that.

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:24.580
Really!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.470
Heh!

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:30.000
Oh, yes, that's why we came, right?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.440
Somehow, just being with those
people makes things enjoyable.

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:47.850
See you later, Chika.

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:49.220
Till tomorrow.

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:50.290
