00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.120
See you next time.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:32.560
Oh, it's raining!

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:33.720
You're right.

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:39.340
Grandma.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:42.130
School is fun, so I like it, though.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:47.680
But I really love this house,
full of my wonderful family!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.820
We're home!

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:57.560
Welcome home!

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:37.960
