00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:41.630
Sweat scattering, miniskirts flapping,

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:44.710
pure white thighs, underskirts,

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:46.460
and... and...

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:47.220
And?

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:49.970
Bouncing breasts! Breasts! Breasts!

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:52.970
Throbing moments!{Man, it sets my heart on fire!}

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:55.660
Next time, Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi,

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:56.560
Tennis.

00:22:57.640 --> 00:22:59.390
